    "commit_body": "Rebuilt EARN_BOOST's lift table on look-ahead-free v69 pre_boost scores,\nholdout-locked (<=2026-05-15). The earnings premium survives look-ahead\nremoval as a RELATIVE effect, but lives in the pre7 run-up (4-7 cal days\nbefore earnings), NOT pre1 (the v34 pre1-heavy cells were a weekly-look-ahead\nartifact). New table is both-barrier-gated (generic AND option-aligned WR15\nlift > 0): 5 call cells (pre7-dominant), puts effectively off (no honest edge).\n\nChanges:\n- database/utils/scoring.py: lift table -> experiments/earnboost_honest/lift_table_v70.json\n- strategy_config.py: EARN_BOOST_WINDOW 5->7 (see the pre7 run-up); PESS_DAYS_MAX\n  7->5 (behavior-preserving: PESS was already capped at 5 by the shared window;\n  decouples PESS from the boost so widening the window has no PESS side effect)\n\nValidated (holdout-locked, tradable/opt WR15): affected cohort 48.7->52.8%,\n85+ tier 47.6->49.7% (+2.1pp), 75+ +0.2pp, boundary admits 51.4% (accretive).\nDay-to-day whiplash REDUCED vs v34 (82-stock max swing 16->12). Calibration\ntrail + FINDINGS in experiments/earnboost_honest/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "commit_short": "c70d16d22",
